On 7/27/19 5:26 AM, Richard Purdie wrote:
> On Fri, 2019-07-26 at 15:46 +0000, chris.laplante--- via bitbake-devel
> wrote:
>>> -----Original Message-----
>>> From: Alexander Kanavin <alex.kanavin@gmail.com>
